<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Vmware - 標籤 | 奇風歲月</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/vmware/</link><description>独立开发者 Travis Bikkle 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.138.0 &amp; FixIt v0.3.15-fd15415b</generator><language>zh-hant</language><managingEditor>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</managingEditor><webMaster>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2024 06:25:21 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/vmware/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Vmware 死機但是鼠標可以動</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2024/03/vmware-freeze/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 17:09:19 +0000</pubDate><author>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2024/03/vmware-freeze/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h2 id="問題現象" class="heading-element">&lt;span>問題現象&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e5%95%8f%e9%a1%8c%e7%8f%be%e8%b1%a1" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>宿主機&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Win11&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>客戶機&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Kubuntu 22.04&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>vmware&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>vmware workstation pro 17.5&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;br />
&lt;p>在使用 VSCode 的時候，我的客戶機總是沒有規律的死機，這個時候鼠標可以移動，但是無法點擊。能看出來客戶機並沒有真正的死機。我曾經監控過 /var/log 下面的日誌，以及用 top 監控過系統資源情況，但是沒能發現任何異常。後來在宿主機的虛擬機目錄 vmware.log 中，看到如下一行日誌，才明白髮生了什麼：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Vmware 中 Intellij Idea 快捷鍵錯誤</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/12/idea-shortkey-error-in-vmware/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Dec 2023 11:24:32 +0800</pubDate><author>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/12/idea-shortkey-error-in-vmware/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>在VMware中，&lt;kbd>CTRL ALT&lt;/kbd>是默認的將鼠標焦點從虛擬機中移開的熱鍵，這將導致一切在Vmware中運行的虛擬機系統中以該組合鍵
位開頭的熱鍵不可用。比如Intellij Idea的默認後退快捷鍵&lt;kbd>CTRL ALT LEFT&lt;/kbd>。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>一開始我以爲是KDE熱鍵衝突的問題，因爲KDE默認有很多的快捷鍵，但是經過查看KDE的系統設置，並沒有發現熱鍵佔用的情況：&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="lightgallery" href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png?size=large" data-thumbnail="/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png?size=small" data-sub-html="&lt;h2>Screenshot_20231201_163449.png&lt;/h2>">&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png" alt="Screenshot_20231201_163449.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/Screenshot_20231201_163449.png?size=large 2x" data-title="Screenshot_20231201_163449.png" style="--width: 2662px;--aspect-ratio: 2662 / 1417;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>直到我意識到screenkey也沒有提示，這說明我的KDE根本沒有接收到&lt;kbd>CTRL ALT LEFT&lt;/kbd>按鍵。答案顯而易見，是Vmware的問題了。
爲了防止衝突，在Vmware的 &lt;em>編輯-首選項-熱鍵&lt;/em> 中可以將這四個按鍵都勾選上。
&lt;a class="lightgallery" href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png?size=large" data-thumbnail="/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png?size=small" data-sub-html="&lt;h2>20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png&lt;/h2>">&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png" alt="20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png?size=large 2x" data-title="20231201_vmware_pref_hotkey.png" style="--width: 904px;--aspect-ratio: 904 / 983;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Vmware Power-ON 腳本啓動失敗</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/11/vmware-poweron-script/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Nov 2023 11:24:33 +0800</pubDate><author>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/11/vmware-poweron-script/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>VMware 的開機腳本位於 &lt;code>/etc/vmware-tools/&lt;/code> 下。如果你的虛擬機報錯啓動客戶機腳本失敗，你可以在虛擬機-電源-開機中開機，然後進入該目錄調試。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>如果你的vmware-tools進行過升級，但是升級過程中出現了問題，可能導致腳本沒有正確命名。比如，下面是開機、關機等操作對應的腳本名稱&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">poweroff-vm-default
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">poweron-vm-default
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">resume-vm-default
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">suspend-vm-default
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vgauth.conf&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>而你的機器上可能是&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">poweroff-vm-default.dpkg-dist
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">poweron-vm-default.dpkg-dist
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">resume-vm-default.dpkg-dist
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">suspend-vm-default.dpkg-dist
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vgauth.conf.dpkg-dist&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>那麼請執行以下命令重命名即可&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">find /etc/vmware-tools/ -name &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;*.dpkg-dist&amp;#34;&lt;/span> -exec sh -c &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;x={}; cp &amp;#34;$x&amp;#34; $(echo $x | sed &amp;#39;&lt;/span>s/&lt;span class="se">\.&lt;/span>dpkg-dist//g&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;)&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>另外你還可能需要檢查 &lt;code>/etc/vmware-tools/scripts/vmware&lt;/code> 以及各個腳本是否具有可執行權限。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Windows Vmware Amd-V 開啓</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/11/win11-vmware-amd-v/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Nov 2023 11:24:35 +0800</pubDate><author>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/11/win11-vmware-amd-v/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h4 id="報錯現象" class="heading-element">&lt;span>報錯現象&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e5%a0%b1%e9%8c%af%e7%8f%be%e8%b1%a1" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>我在 Win 11 中安裝了 Vmware，並在Vmware中安裝了 Kubuntu 22.04 虛擬機。
當我在虛擬機設置的cpu設置中開啓AMD-V的時候，Vmware提示如下錯誤：
&lt;a class="lightgallery" href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png?size=large" data-thumbnail="/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png?size=small" data-sub-html="&lt;h2>2023-11-14-exec-gpedit.png&lt;/h2>">&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png" alt="2023-11-14-exec-gpedit.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231114_vmware_amdv_error.png?size=large 2x" data-title="2023-11-14-exec-gpedit.png" style="--width: 511px;--aspect-ratio: 511 / 190;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>